    "Vietnamese VND prices not sourced (VinFast's Vietnamese site blocked automated fetching); only one INR price for the VF MPV 7.",
    "Vietnamese ranges are published on the NEDC cycle, which the schema does not support, so VF 3, VF 5, VF e34, Limo Green and Minio Green have no range.",
    "VF 8 and VF 9 battery sizes per US trim and model year not confirmed (82 vs 87.7 kWh; 92 vs 123 kWh); left null.",
    "EPA certified a 2025 VF 6 Plus (176 mi) and 2025/2027 VF 7 Plus (209 mi), but vinfastauto.us offers only the VF 8 and VF 9; US offerings for VF 6/VF 7 omitted pending confirmation.",
    "VF 7 WLTP ranges (Eco FWD 450 km, Plus AWD 431 km per Wikipedia) not entered: no schema market key for Vietnam and the VF 7 is not confirmed on sale in the EU.",
    "VF 8 second generation details beyond the Vietnam FWD version not sourced; VF Wild, EC Van specs not sourced.",
    "Indonesia and Philippines markets are not schema market keys, so they are only mentioned in descriptions."
